From 112ee9563646d4ee3db6c73ba5b9011d9e2889bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hang(Harry) Gao <GaohRyan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 22:21:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] repro: goal_contract=official (actor goal layout and
 anchor body of the official release)

Official release (HybridRobotics/supermimic @ 5efbf11): actor goal = joint targets
[joint_pos, joint_vel] of 10 reference frames spaced 5 control steps apart, plus the
reference root orientation at those frames relative to the robot root (rot6d), no
noise on the goal group; anchor body = pelvis. Selected with
--env.goal-contract official --env.anchor-obs --env.anchor-obs-mode ori_window.
Goal width 640. Defaults unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
